WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.592
Aisha deputy A deputy is an agreed stand-in who

00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:07.737
carries out specified duties for someone else during an

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:12.145
agreed period In this case Aisha may cover Daniel’s

00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:15.355
work only after she has accepted the particular duties

00:00:15.395 --> 00:00:17.987
and dates and has the information and access she

00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:21.711
needs Being named as deputy does not give her

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:26.710
all of Daniel’s responsibilities or unlimited decision authority Any

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.934
limits and unresolved arrangements must remain clear
